vczh Coda plugin

The prompt packs and workflow instructions adapt and generalize material from
vczh-libraries/Tools, Copilot/, by vczh and contributors, at commit
493f3fe00b4a48831c1cc0612184fde709bafcb2.

Upstream: https://github.com/vczh-libraries/Tools
Licensing statement: https://github.com/vczh-libraries/License/blob/master/README.md

Changes include Chinese paraphrasing, removal of project-specific constraints,
explicit applicability and exceptions, and adaptation to Coda's workflows,
project-local knowledge storage, and paired prompt management.

This plugin is not an official vczh project or an endorsement by the upstream authors.
The reference repository source code and assets are not distributed with this plugin.
